	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Colossus"},
			{
"“─────!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The roar of the colossal golems splits the air.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A dreadful cry of bottomless savagery that evokes the instinctual fear possessed by all living creatures.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Before they even realize it, one Republican soldier after another freezes in terror, their weapons held limply in their hands.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Colossus"},
			{
"“─────!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"As a child trifling with ants, the giants reave apart the Republican formation with their massive arms.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't abandon your comrades!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"In the blink of an eye, the Republican Army suffers incalculable casualties.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The warriors valiantly press their attack, but the enormous bodies of the giants repel even their spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, we need to pull back.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And then what?!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have a plan. Just trust me.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All right. We'll cover the retreat.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, do you have a stratagem in mind?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, it may very well destroy the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The Imperial Palace is a revered symbol of the Empire to the Imperial people.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"It is only natural that Empress Hisui might have her reservations.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The loss of a mere structure is but a small price to pay that we may prevail.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks for being so understanding, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, pull back as soon as I give the signal!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Understood!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori rallies the warriors as they hold their ground against the giants.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"─How finely, how nobly they bear themselves.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Watching them from behind, Elsa sighs softly in admiration.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The warriors, too, are suffering horrific casualties.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Yet they continue to fearlessly stand against these nightmarish monstrosities.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Struck by their peerless nobility, Elsa reaches for her radio, her eyes swimming with determination.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The Republican Army can't hope to match up to the martial valor of the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"But there is one advantage they undoubtedly possess─",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Requesting close air support.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Target is the Imperial Palace interior courtyard. Hit it with all the firepower you've got.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Elsa's transmission is with the aircraft carrier just off the coast of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"She had made preparations for its strike group to be armed and on standby in the event of such an emergency.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, withdraw now!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Got it! Pull back!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Moving like the receding tide, the warriors all retreat in a matter of seconds.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"All that remains in the courtyard are the colossal golems.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh? What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Streaks of white light scream over Sekka's head.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Attack aircraft...”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"As they drop their payload, a deep rumble reverberates through the earth.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The once-pristine gravel of the courtyard is turned up and obliterated by the symphony of explosions.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"More and more bombs fall, rendering the ground into a churning, roiling crucible.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The slow, lumbering giants are powerless to escape.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Explosions mercilessly shatter their legs and splinter enormous chunks from their collapsed bodies.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The seemingly indomitable colossi are felled one after another right before Elsa and Hotori's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This just might work out.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, nice to have them on our side for once.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Hotori is no stranger to the devastating firepower on display before her.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"In the war three years ago, the Republic's airstrikes claimed the lives of over twenty thousand warriors and their families.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"The thought that those same aircraft are now her stalwart allies can't help but bring a wry smile to her face.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Just as the first wave of bombers completes its attack, the sound of the second wave approaches over the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Bracing for the imminent explosions, the warriors and Republican soldiers duck for cover.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Annoying flies.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Yet a voice as cold as ice pierces their ears.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"They look up to find the priestess of darkness standing atop the roof of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Sekka directs her cool gaze towards the attack aircraft screaming in across the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"And in the next moment─",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"They explode in plumes of black smoke.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Elsa stares in dismay as the planes plummet perilously towards the ground, drawing trails of burning fire across the sky.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Deadlier than any anti-aircraft weaponry, the shattered fragments of the golems on the ground had been launched with impossible speed to down the Republican warplanes.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"All of it occurred so quickly that only a handful of warriors were even able to perceive what just happened.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sh-She shot them down?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Playtime's over.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“It's high time I brought this to an end.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Sekka thrusts her hand up towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“O karmic distortions falling upon Ne no Kuni, grant me your power!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"At Sekka's command, the karmic distortions emanating from Kotone coalesce into a swirling gyre that darkens the sky above the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"All the black snow that had been falling down across Tenkyo is concentrated in the palm of her hand.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The storm gathers, growing darker and denser.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Freeze to the last man, if you will.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(Ah... uuh...)”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I try to speak but cannot.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The vast amounts of magicks surging through me render me as helpless as a leaf drifting at the mercy of a muddy stream.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Endless amounts of karmic distortions flow through my veins like ice─",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"And emerge into this world in the form of that black snow.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"As the numbing cold embraces me, I am overtaken by a sensation I could never forget.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Falling, falling─",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Through pitch black darkness─",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Deeper, deeper still, through two thousand years of accumulated snowfall─",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Just how much snow must be there in Ne no Kuni?",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"If it gathers at a rate of one meter per year, that would make for two thousand meters’ worth.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"─Perhaps I will continue to fall like this for all eternity.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"─Perhaps that would not be so bad...",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Just as cold resignation threatens to seize my heart, I sense a tremor in the depths of the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			hide=1,
			{
"...WHO DARES...",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			hide=1,
			{
"...WHO DARES DISTURB MY WORLD...",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			hide=1,
			{
"...WHO DARES WAKE ME... FROM MY SLUMBER...",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"All my hairs stand on end.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"A deep, abiding chill envelops me, causing the chill of the snow to feel like nothing by comparison.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I tremble despite myself.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			hide=1,
			{
"LIGHT...",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Is that... a voice?",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"It feels far too ominous to be called as such, yet it has a divine resonance all the same.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			hide=1,
			{
"GIVE ME LIGHT...",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"A looming presence rises up from the abyss.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"An extraordinary presence, not of this world─",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Kuronushi-no-Ookami.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"His anger is palpable.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"He seeks vengeance for the defilement of His dominion by two thousand years of karmic distortions.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Oh, Oomikami... May You deliver us from the wrath to come...",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"The palace courtyard is engulfed in a raging blizzard.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The black snow─whose mere touch is enough to sap an ordinary human's vitality─falls mercilessly upon the Imperials and Republicans alike.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Yet there are no screams.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"One by one, the Republican soldiers are overcome, curling up on the ground with scarcely a whimper.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ahh... Ngh...!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Koyuzu dives in front of her Empress, shielding her from the ominous black snow.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...My thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Shame threatens to overwhelm Kanami as she clutches her freezing body.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Despite being born to a house of warriors, she is relying on the protection of a girl even more tender in years than herself.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"─The warrior factor failed to manifest in me, so I am powerless to fight.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Though Kanami understands this reasoning, she cannot accept it.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Is she fated to only be a hindrance as everyone else fights on?",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Onii-sama, why must this be?)”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Even at this most crucial juncture, I am nothing but a burden upon the warriors...)”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"─Am I nothing but a powerless puppet Empress, after all?",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"These despairing thoughts swirl about in Kanami's head.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Thunderous footfalls echo out amid the howling winds of the blizzard.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Despite the Republican Army having expended the last of its air power─",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The colossal golems that were pulverized by the bombings have already reformed themselves.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"A blizzard that freezes the soul, and enemies immune to spellblades─",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(...What can we do?)”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Even in the midst of the blizzard, Hotori breaks out in a cold sweat.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"The premonition of death clings cloyingly to her back.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We won't be able to move much longer. It's now or never.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's ignore those monsters and go straight for that woman.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Elsa takes her handgun out of its holster and begins chambering it one round at a time.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"It appears no different from an old-fashioned revolver, save for the intricate patterns reminiscent of spellcrests engraved on its body.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's that?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A ≪hybrid≫ between Republican technology and Imperial magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've got two shots. Which means I can take down two of those things.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Music to my ears.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Even so, there are over a dozen colossal golems standing between them and Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sarashina, Koyuzu, attack the monsters on their flanks and divide their formation in two.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Elsa and I will break through their weakened center and take down the priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Mutsumi and Koyuzu nod their heads.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is our only chance.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's move!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"At her signal, Mutsumi and Koyuzu initiate their flanking maneuver.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Not even a warrior could hope to survive the slightest blow from any of the colossal golems.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Despite this, the pair rushes fearlessly into the fray, dodging a flurry of giant fists as they draw all attention to them.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"The enemy ranks are thrown into chaos, and just as Hotori hoped, their center grows thin.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Elsa's spellcraft revolver erupts with fire.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"The projectiles of magicks it ejects coil around their targets, piercing them time and time again─",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Reducing two of the mighty golems to splinters.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaaaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"With nothing now standing in her path, Hotori charges across the palace courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heheh, one last desperate counterattack to try and bring down the enemy general?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is for my father!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Not so fast!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Just as Shiranui's flames appear to engulf Sekka, they are repelled by an invisible wall.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh?!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"As Hotori grimaces with dismay, a projectile whizzes underneath her arm─",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Shattering Sekka's Spellshield to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sorry about that. Forgot to mention I actually had one more shot.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh n─”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fuh!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Hotori lunges within striking range.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“...But not today.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Ringing out from nowhere in particular, the tinkling sound of a bell stays Hotori's hand.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"To vanquish Sekka, to avenge her father─",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"She needs only to swing Shiranui down.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Yet she does not, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"cannot",
{"/font"},
" move.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I've dominated your heart once already. Doing so again is nothing but child's play.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Once again, the tinkling of a bell echoes in Hotori's ears.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah... nhh...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Listen, Inou-san.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“While you're here fighting for dear life, Tokita-kun is off merrily cavorting with Her Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Doesn't that upset you? Doesn't that make you feel sorry for yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“During the uprising in the summer, you even put yourself on the line in order to allow them to escape.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But they've already forgotten all about you.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sou... Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Hotori collapses to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san?!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why...? Why is it... always me...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's right, dear. It ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" unfair that you're the only one who has to suffer.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Come, let us take our revenge together.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Shiranui held slackly at her side, Hotori turns to face Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Her hollow eyes contain not a single spark of intelligence.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Unforgivable.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's right. What they've done ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" unforgivable.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't... I won't... I'll never...!”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll never forgive...”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...My weak past self.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Sekka's severed hand, still clutching the prayer bell, soars through the air.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Yet before it even lands, Hotori's second strike splits the\npriestess's chest wide open.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Gh...! Nghhh...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Impossible... My magicks...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Hotori looks down on Sekka with perfectly lucid eyes.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Her bonds with Soujin, forged in the flames of battle, exist on a much higher plane than mere romantic love.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Though they stand on different battlefields, they can still keenly feel each other's presence.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"There is absolutely no room between them for Sekka's magicks to interfere.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't trifle with me, priestess of darkness.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heh... Guess I let my guard down...”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"With a light thud, Yagi Sekka collapses backwards into a drift of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Her animated golems follow suit, letting out one final roar before crumbling to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Kotone-san!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Kanami lets out a scream as the chains of magicks binding Kotone come undone.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Her body pitches forward as it tumbles towards the flagstones below.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've got her!”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Hotori dashes towards her landing spot and gently catches Kotone in her arms.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Only a warrior could be so agile.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kotone? Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Safe in Hotori's arms, Kotone wearily flutters her eyelids open.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hotori... sama?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I believe so.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Thank you... but I can walk on my own...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Leaning on Hotori's shoulder for support, Kotone steps to the ground with shaky legs.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Rather than relief, her face is a mask of grimness as she stares at Sekka's prone form.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Go ahead... and finish me...”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Sekka murmurs as she stares upwards with vacant eyes.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll grant your request.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"But before Hotori can react, Kotone begins staggering towards Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"At this unusual display from the mild-mannered Exalt-Priestess, Hotori falls still, looking silently on.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Your Eminence... is to be the one to end me...? Hehehee, I can live with that...”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“*Cough!* *Cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Before she even realizes it, Kotone's hands are clasped around the ritual dagger at her chest.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"This is the woman who killed not only the former Exalt-Priestess, but countless captured priestesses besides.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"The architect behind the Republican assault on Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"The person responsible for the countless lives lost during the disturbance in Tenkyo yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Kotone has every reason to consider Yagi Sekka an apostate, a sworn enemy, a blight upon the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Yet her conscience prevents her from plunging her dagger down.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I cannot forgive you.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heheh... That's a nice expression.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Go ahead, do it... Take out all your rage on me...”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"In her mind's eye, Kotone sees herself mounting Sekka and stabbing her dagger down into her chest, over and over again.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"The mere thought of it seizes her heart with a perverse swell of pleasure.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"She wants to kill her.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"She suddenly remembers what Sekka said to her.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Yes, those are the eyes I've been waiting to see.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hate me. Despise me. Revile me until you drown in your resentment!”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Then, for once in your life, you'll finally understand how we priestesses of Yagi have felt for two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Kotone realizes just how dreadful the expression she is wearing must be.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"─Oh, how easy, how satisfying it would be to give into my rage and kill Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(But I mustn't.)”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"─The duty of the Exalt-Priestess is to preserve the eternal innocence of the Imperial people.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"─If I let myself be consumed by vengeance, how am I ever to bring healing to the sick and redemption to the lost?",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"And who is Sekka but another of Kotone's congregation, to whom she must grant salvation?",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am the Exalt-Priestess. Mine is not to kill.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Kotone lets go of her dagger.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Spare me the niceties...”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'm your enemy, aren't I? If you don't kill me while you have the chance, you'll regret it...”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even if I do come to regret it... I have made peace with that.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My place is not to exact revenge.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Sekka bitterly averts her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"As though turning away from an accursedly brilliant, blinding light.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The sins that you have committed must be answered for.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I pray that in your final moments, you may at least be redeemed from the muck of resentment and find peace.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How you must have suffered, living your whole life mired in such darkness.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you...”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Rest now. House Yagi has no need for vengeance any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“...!”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Sekka wordlessly opens her eyes wide.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"There is no winter which does not end, and there is no ice which does not melt─",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Words that even children might find naïve nonetheless melt Sekka's frozen tears.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“(You're a fool...)”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I said you're a fool... Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heh... Heheheh... My death... doesn't mark the end of anything...”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“True despair... is nigh upon you...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Sekka extends a trembling hand towards the empty sky─",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Empty, save for one object─the Ame no Mikagami.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“K-Kuronushi-no-Ookami...”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“House Yagi begs forgiveness... for the end of our rituals...”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Though I am naught but dust and ashes... to offer You all my devotion... was my life's sole blessing...”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Now grant these foolish Imperials... the revelation... of Your divine majesty...”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san? What are you saying?!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Yet Sekka's eyes no longer see Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"They stare only at the Ame no Mikagami... and what lies beyond it.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heh, heheh... I hope you don't think... you can defy a god...”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“All we humans... can do... is revere... and pray...”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san!?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Before she can respond, the last priestess of House Yagi loses consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"The tears spilling from her eyes ever so slightly melt the drifts of black snow piled up beneath her head.",
